      "description": "Playing Verdant Catacombs (fetches Swamp or Forest) before Windswept Heath (fetches Forest or Plains) wastes the more versatile fetch. In this GB deck, Windswept Heath can fetch a Forest for Young Wolf just as well, while saving Verdant Catacombs for later when a Swamp might be needed for black spells like Thoughtseize or Fatal Push.",
